# eza and bat are already installed; these put them in front of the defaults.
# Aliases reach interactive zsh only, so scripts, #! files and anything invoked
# as `bash foo.sh` still get the real ls/cat/top - tmux-health.sh keeps its
# `top -l 2` sampling.
#
# Plain `eza`, not `eza -la`: the earlier `ls="lsd -la"` was dropped because a
